    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MISTY: ...S0 we're in Madrid for one day and it turns out the Cezanne exhibit is next month...\nSAVANNAH: ...SO we just went to Planet Hollywood to hang. And guess who walks in...\nMISTY: Antonio Sabato, Jr.",
      "CHANDLER: Skoozie? On the phone here.\nKATIE: Um. ..What?",
      "KATIE: I’m sure she’s just running late.\nCHANDLER: {on phone) No, no. It was a pair of bone Charles David mules. There’s a strawberry margarita stain on the right one. They’re either next to …",
      "CHANDLER: The last original couple from Freshman year.\nALEX: It’s like my parents are breaking up.\nKATIE: Your parents are broken up.\nALEX: Yeah, but I mean, like, I care this time.",
      "MISTY: {sotto to Savannah) Watch this.\nLANEY: Hey.\nMISTY: Hey. You know, Savannah and I were just talking about you over there.\nLANEY: You were."
    ]
